WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:04.376
Current flows out of pin 0, round the loop, and back to GND.

2
00:00:05.452 --> 00:00:08.352
A complete loop, so the LED lights.

3
00:00:10.082 --> 00:00:13.082
Break the loop anywhere, and the current stops.

4
00:00:14.770 --> 00:00:17.270
Close the loop, and it lights again.
